{
  "item": "R1",
  "scores": {"U": 3, "A": 2, "C": 3, "V": 1},
  "confidences": {"U": 0.7, "A": 0.8, "C": 0.6, "V": 0.9},
  "rationales": {
    "U": "证据片段：'Our development team must thoroughly investigate each website' – 解释：主语'development team'和宾语'each website'明确，但副词'thoroughly'未定义具体程度，影响整体可理解性，因为它依赖于主观判断。",
    "A": "证据片段：'thoroughly investigate'和'illegal or harmful content' – 解释：'thoroughly investigate'缺乏操作定义，'illegal or harmful content'未指定标准或范围，这些术语模糊导致歧义，使得需求解释可能因人而异。",
    "C": "证据片段：'to ensure that no illegal or harmful content is exposed' – 解释：业务目标正确（防止有害内容暴露），但动词'ensure'表达绝对保证，这在实践中可能不切实际，因为无法完全消除风险，影响正确性表述。",
    "V": "证据片段：'ensure that no illegal or harmful content is exposed' – 解释：'ensure no'是绝对陈述，无法通过测试验证否定情况（例如，证明'无内容暴露'），同时'thoroughly investigate'没有可测量指标，使得需求不可验证。"
  },
  "suggestions": {
    "U": "改写为：'开发团队必须每月对数据库中的每个网站执行一次内容审查，审查过程需遵循预定义的步骤和标准。'",
    "A": "改写为：'开发团队应每月检查每个网站，依据法律清单和明确定义的危害类别进行内容评估。'",
    "C": "改写为：'目的是最小化用户接触非法或有害内容的风险，通过定期检查和响应机制。'",
    "V": "改写为：'系统应记录每月检查的详细日志，并报告任何检测到的非法或有害内容实例，同时跟踪整改措施。'"
  },
  "issues": [
    {
      "type": "A",
      "evidence": "'thoroughly investigate'和'illegal or harmful content'",
      "rewrite": "开发团队必须每月依据明确标准（如法律合规列表和危害定义文档）检查每个网站的内容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "V",
      "evidence": "'ensure that no illegal or harmful content is exposed'",
      "rewrite": "每月检查后，应生成报告列出所有发现的非法或有害内容实例，并确保采取相应措施（如屏蔽或通知），报告需可审计。"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "item": "R1",
  "scores": {"U": 2, "A": 2, "C": 3, "V": 1},
  "confidences": {"U": 0.9, "A": 0.95, "C": 0.8, "V": 0.98},
  "rationales": {"U":"'thoroughly investigate' 是主观副词，缺乏可操作定义；'each website within our database' 未说明数据库范围、规模或标识方式，导致读者无法建立一致理解；'illegal or harmful content' 无明确定义，不同司法管辖区和角色对'illegal'和'harmful'有显著差异，严重削弱可理解性。", "A":"'thoroughly investigate' 存在多重解释（人工审查？ automated scan？ depth of crawl？），'illegal or harmful content' 构成语义模糊集合，未提供判定标准或引用权威定义，同一需求在不同评审者间可能触发完全不同的实现方案。", "C":"该需求表达了合理安全目标，符合常见合规意图，但因未锚定具体法律依据（如 GDPR、COPPA）或内容策略文档，正确性依赖外部隐含假设，故评3分；若上下文已明确定义'illegal/harmful'，则本项可提升。", "V":"无任何可观测、可测量的验收条件：未定义'investigate'的输出物（如 report？ flag count？ confidence score？）、未规定检测覆盖率（100% pages？ top N paths？）、未设定误报/漏报容忍阈值、未说明'each month'的起止时刻与时区，导致完全不可测试。"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"Replace with atomic, domain-defined terms and explicit scope.", "A":"Define all evaluative terms via referenced policy documents or measurable criteria.", "C":"Keep unchanged if aligned with organizational content safety policy v2.1; otherwise, anchor to §3.2 of Compliance Handbook.", "V":"Replace with testable statements specifying inputs, outputs, thresholds, and measurement method."},
  "issues": [
    {"type":"U","evidence":"thoroughly investigate each website within our database each month","rewrite":"For every website identified by a non-null 'url' field in the 'active_websites' table (as of UTC midnight on the 1st day of the month), execute the ContentSafetyScan v4.2 workflow."},
    {"type":"A","evidence":"illegal or harmful content","rewrite":"content matching any pattern in the ProhibitedContentTaxonomy v3.0 (SHA-256: a1b2c3...) OR scoring ≥0.95 on the HarmScore model (v2.1) for categories: child_exploitation, terrorist_propaganda, non-consensual_intimate_media."},
    {"type":"V","evidence":"to ensure that no illegal or harmful content is exposed to our users","rewrite":"After each monthly scan, generate a ScanResult JSON report containing: (i) total scanned URLs, (ii) count of URLs flagged with severity ≥ HIGH, (iii) mean latency per URL < 1200ms; and achieve ≤0.001% false-negative rate on the quarterly validation corpus (ref: TEST-CORPUS-Q3-2024)."}
  ]
}
